---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions — Fairrentcalc | Rent Split Calculator"
  description="Fairrentcalc terms and conditions. Read the rules and guidelines for using our rent split calculator, screen calibrator, and listing evaluator tools."
  canonicalUrl="https://fairrentcalc.com/terms"
>
  <div class="py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-link uppercase tracking-wider">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-display-lg text-ink mt-2">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-body text-sm">
        Last updated: June 8, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using fairrentcalc.com (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should not use the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>
          Fairrentcalc provides an online rent split calculator, a credit-card-based screen calibrator, and a listing affordability evaluator. The Service is provided free of charge and is designed to assist roommates in dividing rent fairly based on square footage, room features, and custom weight configurations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">3. Use of the Service</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">You agree to use the Service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Use the Service in any way that violates any applicable law or regulation</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any portion of the Service or its related systems</li>
          <li>Use automated systems, bots, or scripts to access or interact with the Service without our explicit written permission</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Service or servers connected to the Service</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any aspect of the Service</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">4. Accuracy of Calculations</h2>
        <p>
          While we strive for mathematical accuracy, the calculations provided by Fairrentcalc are estimates based on the data you input. The Service does not constitute financial, legal, or real estate advice. We recommend verifying all calculations independently before making financial commitments. The tool should be used as a guideline, not as a definitive agreement between roommates.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          The Service, including its design, code, graphics, logos, and content, is the intellectual property of Fairrentcalc and is protected by applicable copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws. The open-source components of the Service are licensed under their respective open-source licenses as specified in the project repository.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The Service is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall Fairrentcalc, its developers, or affiliates be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or relating to your use of the Service. We shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from your reliance on the calculations or information provided by the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">8. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to this page. Your continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms. We encourage you to review this page periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws. Any disputes arising from or relating to these Terms or the Service shall be resolved in the appropriate courts of the applicable jurisdiction.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-display-md text-ink mb-3">10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us through our <a href="/contact" class="text-link font-medium hover:underline">Contact page</a> or by visiting <a href="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link font-medium hover:underline">our GitHub repository</a>.
